SIF (ABL:MASTER:PeeAddict >= 5 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1) || (ABL:MASTER:PooAddict >= 5 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2)
PRINTFORMDW Sure, you enjoy the feeling of \@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 ?wetting#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ?%" and "%#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ? messing#\@ your pants, but that doesn't mean you don't want to see just how far you can push your \@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 ? bladder #\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ?%" "%and%" "%#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ? bowels #\@!
